#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:1 6af7de80f41b42a9a4b9e6c538b7cc4e
msgid "模型评估"
msgstr "Model evaluation"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:3 bf3984fb6ea843e7b4a8e1b2fb9e8f4b
msgid "UniKT 在训练过程中自动执行验证和测试评估，支持 K 折交叉验证、早停控制和多后端指标追踪。本页介绍评估机制的工作原理、配置方式和输出解读。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT automatically performs validation and test evaluation during training, "
"supporting K-fold cross validation, early stopping control, and multi-backend "
"metric tracking. This page describes how the evaluation mechanism works, how "
"to configure it, and how to interpret its output."

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:5 75300315a51d40869be14e1e31938e88
msgid "K 折交叉验证"
msgstr "K-fold cross validation"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:7 980b40d308144099a1b7c26b5ce41634
msgid ""
"K 折交叉验证是知识追踪领域评估模型稳定性的标准做法。UniKT "
"在数据预处理阶段（``add_kfold_labels``）为用户级别的交互序列打上折标签，确保同一用户的所有交互始终落入同一折，从根本上杜绝数据泄露。"
msgstr ""
"K-fold cross validation is the standard practice for evaluating model "
"stability in knowledge tracing. During data preprocessing "
"(``add_kfold_labels``), UniKT assigns fold labels to user-level interaction "
"sequences, ensuring that all interactions of the same user always fall into "
"the same fold, fundamentally preventing data leakage."

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:9 533cb138b5b54ea09c0c1b741ce99c31
msgid "折标签含义"
msgstr "Fold label meaning"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:11 ea9dfde2c1b649729b0b3ac63a0b2d5a
msgid "折标签存储在序列数据的 ``fold`` 列中："
msgstr "Fold labels are stored in the ``fold`` column of the sequence data:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:13 5f80c3922ba54e50b9be8562c5cdb07d
msgid "**-1**：测试集用户。这些用户完全不参与训练和验证，仅在最终测试阶段使用"
msgstr ""
"**-1**: test set users. These users never participate in training or "
"validation and are used only in the final test phase"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:14 7e5a09ff78be41549c25b2e67a13d244
msgid "**0 ~ K-1**：训练/验证集用户。K 折交叉验证时轮流将其中一份作为验证集，其余作为训练集"
msgstr ""
"**0 ~ K-1**: train/validation users. During K-fold cross validation, one fold "
"takes turns serving as the validation set while the rest serve as the "
"training set"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:16 2128e075ebd541228448c0f69fd038e6
msgid "折的划分在以用户为粒度随机打乱后进行。例如，在 ASSISTments 2009 上运行 5 折交叉验证，``test_ratio=0.2`` 时："
msgstr ""
"Folds are partitioned after shuffling at user granularity. For example, "
"running 5-fold cross validation on ASSISTments 2009 with ``test_ratio=0.2``:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:28 c6cc5228ebdc4d0f85842c02616862c4
msgid ""
"训练时，框架根据 ``--fold`` "
"参数选择当前折作为验证集，其余折作为训练集。验证集用户的数据不参与训练，包括用于构建关系矩阵和题目难度统计时也被排除。"
msgstr ""
"During training, the framework selects the current fold as the validation "
"set based on the ``--fold`` argument and uses the remaining folds as the "
"training set. Validation users' data does not participate in training, "
"including when building relation matrices and question difficulty statistics."

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:31 d1d6f83655284f88b774e403bf29912d
msgid ""
"折的划分在数据预处理时固定（通过 ``data_process.py process --kfold 5 --test_ratio 0.2 "
"--seed 42``）。所有模型使用相同的折分配，确保结果可比。改变 ``--seed`` 会得到不同的折划分。"
msgstr ""
"The fold partition is fixed during data preprocessing (via ``data_process.py "
"process --kfold 5 --test_ratio 0.2 --seed 42``). All models use the same fold "
"assignment, ensuring comparable results. Changing ``--seed`` yields a "
"different fold partition."

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:34 0ed1716b34694c8f86a2e56f8f3d4500
msgid "验证集评估流程"
msgstr "Validation evaluation flow"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:36 b2ff65d537be4fa1b11e0fa937ea9a91
msgid "每个 epoch 分为训练阶段和验证阶段，两个阶段各自累积指标后计算 epoch 级汇总："
msgstr ""
"Each epoch is split into a training phase and a validation phase, each "
"accumulating metrics independently before computing epoch-level summaries:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:38 8d1f9d900a6d4f1bbc5bbed0effea728
msgid ""
"**训练阶段**（phase=train）：遍历训练 DataLoader，每个 batch 执行前向传播、损失计算和反向传播，累积预测结果到 "
"``MetricsAccumulator``"
msgstr ""
"**Training phase** (phase=train): iterates over the training DataLoader, "
"performing forward pass, loss computation, and backpropagation per batch, and "
"accumulates predictions into ``MetricsAccumulator``"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:39 6e5262afcc37494dbb06ff7037ec4962
msgid ""
"**验证阶段**（phase=val）：以 ``torch.inference_mode`` 遍历验证 "
"DataLoader，只做前向传播和损失计算，不更新参数"
msgstr ""
"**Validation phase** (phase=val): iterates over the validation DataLoader "
"under ``torch.inference_mode``, performing only the forward pass and loss "
"computation without updating parameters"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:40 312b99269d1c4ded82f5a4763b40492e
msgid ""
"**指标计算**：每个 phase 结束时调用 ``MetricsAccumulator.compute`` 计算 "
"``acc``（准确率）、``auc``（AUC 分数）和 ``rmse``（均方根误差）"
msgstr ""
"**Metric computation**: at the end of each phase, ``MetricsAccumulator."
"compute`` is called to compute ``acc`` (accuracy), ``auc`` (AUC score), and "
"``rmse`` (root mean squared error)"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:42 b23bd1a8c772428f96c425b2da000e0e
msgid "这三个指标的计算基于 ``forward_pass`` 输出的四个字段："
msgstr ""
"These three metrics are computed from the four fields returned by "
"``forward_pass``:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 5d9fa5aab8ed41de9c2298bd4d4d8ba0
msgid "字段"
msgstr "Field"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30
