#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:52 a628520b089f405084ee8c493288e373
msgid "这些字段在 ``forward_pass`` 的返回值字典中定义，所有模型训练器子类必须实现。"
msgstr ""
"These fields are defined in the return dict of ``forward_pass`` and must be "
"implemented by all model trainer subclasses."

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:54 8d7aa2edff6542f5a3910124b5428169
msgid "早停"
msgstr "Early stopping"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:56 d88cda4d727d42ff817a22e9766f2d4e
msgid ""
"早停机制在验证阶段结束时触发，根据监控指标的变化趋势决定是否提前终止训练。UniKT 的早停由两部分协作完成：配置对象 "
"``EarlyStoppingConfig`` 负责存储参数，工具类 ``EarlyStopping`` 负责状态跟踪和判断逻辑。"
msgstr ""
"Early stopping triggers at the end of the validation phase, deciding whether "
"to terminate training early based on the trend of the monitored metric. "
"UniKT's early stopping is driven by two cooperating parts: the "
"``EarlyStoppingConfig`` config object stores parameters, while the "
"``EarlyStopping`` utility handles state tracking and decision logic."

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:58 6f8af67d47f54cd0a7b4fd28d6a051a5
msgid "命令行参数"
msgstr "CLI arguments"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:60 ea3e8d52bae14b359df88ec396744044
msgid "所有早停参数在命令行中通过 ``--es_*`` 前缀指定："
msgstr ""
"All early stopping parameters are specified on the CLI with the ``--es_*`` "
"prefix:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 d88f6b62050047899cb46df3ec7cb071
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 d5cad63f5683458791118cab8120fe3c
msgid "默认值"
msgstr "Default"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 7ad12f7b9bc64b58b48a9e147e92ebf0
msgid "描述"
msgstr "Description"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 a06d98b6eeee4d6ca6a41bfb06c0d064
msgid "``--es_patience``"
msgstr "``--es_patience``"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 76055a27ff9149239ff45414ddf1c457
msgid "10"
msgstr "10"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 141d460342974e128337cfd547647b97
msgid "容忍的 epoch 数。设为 0 禁用早停"
msgstr "Number of tolerated epochs. Set to 0 to disable early stopping"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 a7de8a7006ab410ea1e387965a2028af
msgid "``--es_monitor``"
msgstr "``--es_monitor``"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 7ece49ee392d4e6b9a4233eed2366e4f
msgid "auc"
msgstr "auc"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 6a9a9a921c054aa19cbf34d8a095d999
msgid "监控的指标名（auc / acc / rmse / loss）"
msgstr "Monitored metric name (auc / acc / rmse / loss)"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 80e523c87677491c876a234eeaf52560
msgid "``--es_mode``"
msgstr "``--es_mode``"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 fd691974b14d498ab81d54fe10a3fb5f
msgid "max"
msgstr "max"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 652ba7c8cbeb43749df6a5f3f9b29f09
msgid "优化方向：``max`` 用于 auc/acc，``min`` 用于 rmse/loss"
msgstr "Optimization direction: ``max`` for auc/acc, ``min`` for rmse/loss"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 e9ed7b5d0f8e433b9079e8a1d2ac6ade
msgid "``--es_min_delta``"
msgstr "``--es_min_delta``"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 9f019a41954141eda1aaba56478aa527
msgid "0.0"
msgstr "0.0"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 e5ae25dda869487faed218a07cb772c9
msgid "最小改善阈值，当前指标与历史最优的差值超过此值才视为有效改进"
msgstr ""
"Minimum improvement threshold; the difference between the current metric and "
"the historical best must exceed this to count as a valid improvement"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 2b6470da3d694de3a2fee6e5ac748631
msgid "``--es_restore_best``"
msgstr "``--es_restore_best``"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 fe5eb0d2c909421bbb33abedfaac3fce
msgid "False"
msgstr "False"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:30 79d9d6c56483485d894b9b53e2fa4b53
msgid "早停触发后是否恢复最佳模型权重"
msgstr "Whether to restore the best model weights after early stopping triggers"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:80 d036bd759b2142a38833e174bc9296f4
msgid "工作原理"
msgstr "How it works"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:82 8e85d9e3b640444fadbce4c20aca98ac
msgid "每个 epoch 验证阶段结束后，``EarlyStoppingCallback.on_phase_end`` 被调用："
msgstr ""
"After the validation phase of each epoch, "
"``EarlyStoppingCallback.on_phase_end`` is called:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:84 184c5884df4747699c58936dfa3de9ba
msgid ""
"从 ``metrics`` 字典中按 ``--es_monitor`` 指定的名称取当前指标值。若名称对应的值不存在，按 ``auc → acc "
"→ rmse`` 的优先级自动回退"
msgstr ""
"Reads the current metric value from the ``metrics`` dict by the name "
"specified by ``--es_monitor``. If the named value does not exist, it "
"automatically falls back in the priority order ``auc → acc → rmse``"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:85 958b5765c962405d8a234585c1bb3322
msgid "调用 ``EarlyStopping.step(current, epoch, metrics)`` 进行判断："
msgstr "Calls ``EarlyStopping.step(current, epoch, metrics)`` to make the decision:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:87 2c01ce9ed40545489bb083b0d81fb7f6
msgid "首次调用时记录当前值为 ``best_score``，返回不停止"
msgstr ""
"On the first call, records the current value as ``best_score`` and returns "
"no-stop"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:88 fbc988cf965548d784364a2c9df62fbf
msgid ""
"之后每次比较当前值与 ``best_score``，若改善超过 ``min_delta`` 则更新 ``best_score`` 和 "
"``best_epoch``，重置 ``num_bad_epochs``"
msgstr ""
"On subsequent calls, compares the current value with ``best_score``; if the "
"improvement exceeds ``min_delta``, updates ``best_score`` and ``best_epoch`` "
"and resets ``num_bad_epochs``"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:89 d663f60edfcc4b5b8f087ae3528414b6
msgid "若未改善则 ``num_bad_epochs`` 累加，达到 ``patience`` 时返回停止信号"
msgstr ""
"If there is no improvement, ``num_bad_epochs`` increments; when it reaches "
"``patience``, a stop signal is returned"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:91 a44879e8862b46e19c066f1c4a0120fb
msgid "若启用了 ``--es_restore_best``，训练结束后自动恢复 ``best_epoch`` 对应的模型权重"
msgstr ""
"If ``--es_restore_best`` is enabled, the model weights corresponding to "
"``best_epoch`` are automatically restored after training ends"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:93 bb9a7edd5747431782628d8984e05319
msgid ""
"在验证集 AUC 波动较大的场景（如数据量小或模型不稳定时），适当增大 ``--es_min_delta``（如 "
"0.005）可以避免因噪声提前停止。在 ASSISTments 2009 上训练 GIKT，AUC 通常在前 20 个 epoch 上升显著，设置"
" ``--es_patience 10`` 足以捕捉最佳点。"
msgstr ""
"When validation AUC fluctuates significantly (e.g. with small datasets or "
"unstable models), increasing ``--es_min_delta`` (e.g. to 0.005) can avoid "
"stopping early due to noise. When training GIKT on ASSISTments 2009, AUC "
"typically rises markedly in the first 20 epochs, so ``--es_patience 10`` is "
"enough to capture the best point."

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:96 1a0044c3f54749feb60b9759d78426c2
msgid "早停只基于验证集表现，不接触测试集数据。测试集在训练完全结束后才参与最终评估。"
msgstr ""
"Early stopping is based solely on validation performance and never touches "
"the test data. The test set participates in final evaluation only after "
"training has fully completed."

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:99 e8b31dd050824e7ba9259d32012c63c3
msgid "测试集评估"
msgstr "Test set evaluation"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:101 c24c86573949413295cbbdb8d4e3f36c
msgid ""
"训练循环结束后，``TestEvaluationCallback`` "
"自动触发测试集评估。测试集用户（fold=-1）在整个训练过程中从未被使用，确保评估结果反映模型在未见过的学生上的泛化能力。"
msgstr ""
"After the training loop ends, ``TestEvaluationCallback`` automatically "
"triggers test set evaluation. Test set users (fold=-1) are never used during "
"training, ensuring the evaluation results reflect the model's ability to "
"generalize to unseen students."

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:103 1f1ff2c4b93b451489edec6a6460a40c
msgid "评估流程"
msgstr "Evaluation flow"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:105 7c7d0d3eb032421a829f8eb474a4a8a5
msgid ""
"加载最佳模型：从 ``CheckpointCallback`` 中获取验证集最佳 epoch "
"对应的模型权重（``best_model_state``），加载到模型上"
msgstr ""
"Load the best model: retrieves the model weights corresponding to the best "
"validation epoch from ``CheckpointCallback`` (``best_model_state``) and loads "
"them into the model"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:106 c3c3e2e9f37b401195269b8d13b9b8e7
msgid ""
"遍历测试集：以 ``torch.inference_mode`` 遍历测试 DataLoader，调用 ``test_forward_pass``"
" 执行前向传播"
msgstr ""
"Iterate over the test set: iterates over the test DataLoader under "
"``torch.inference_mode``, calling ``test_forward_pass`` to run the forward "
"pass"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:107 cd89ad47a789410a839bb8affb7f7902
msgid "计算指标：调用 ``MetricsAccumulator.compute(\"test\")`` 计算测试指标"
msgstr ""
"Compute metrics: calls ``MetricsAccumulator.compute(\"test\")`` to compute "
"the test metrics"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:109 8d99ca7bdd4644cbb8919925db7e63a6
msgid ""
"测试集评估会额外输出三种 group 聚合指标。当 ``forward_pass`` 的返回值包含 ``group_id``（题目级分组 "
"ID）时，``MetricsAccumulator`` 对每组内的预测分数聚合后再计算指标。数据集 ``assistments09`` "
"按题目分组后，输出示例："
msgstr ""
"Test set evaluation additionally outputs three group aggregation metrics. "
"When the return value of ``forward_pass`` contains ``group_id`` (a question-"
"level group ID), ``MetricsAccumulator`` aggregates the prediction scores "
"within each group before computing metrics. Example output after grouping "
"the ``assistments09`` dataset by question:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:126 a557d6d49a0f4eec98741272a95716aa
msgid "三种聚合方式的含义："
msgstr "Meaning of the three aggregation modes:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:128 6919deefbf9e4b88a0a77084aa597b01
msgid "**mean**：组内所有时间步的预测分数取均值后计算指标"
msgstr ""
"**mean**: the prediction scores of all time steps within the group are "
"averaged before computing the metric"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:129 871bb3b08b4145388603b8ee07490b8b
msgid "**vote**：组内按多数正确的方向取模型输出，组内多数答对的取正确子集、多数答错的取错误子集"
msgstr ""
"**vote**: the model output is taken in the majority-correct direction within "
"the group — the correct subset when the majority of the group answers "
"correctly, and the incorrect subset when the majority answers incorrectly"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:130 335b4bcc86d34f62a2170188620062ee
msgid "**all**：组内全对或全错时用整组预测，其余按多数方向取子集"
msgstr ""
"**all**: when the whole group is correct or incorrect, the entire group "
"prediction is used; otherwise a subset is taken in the majority direction"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:132 4d8fcbd8832e41e09dae83e8ba9d7fae
msgid "训练时可以通过 ``--skip_test`` 跳过测试集评估（仅执行训练和验证）："
msgstr ""
