"``y_label`` using sklearn's ``roc_auc_score``:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:246 5108c11264e84e6fbf1925a712fc1189
msgid "当数据中只有单一类别（全 0 或全 1）时，``roc_auc_score`` 会抛出异常，此时 AUC 记录为 0.0。"
msgstr ""
"When the data contains only a single class (all 0s or all 1s), "
"``roc_auc_score`` raises an exception and AUC is recorded as 0.0."

