msgstr ""
"Compares the predicted probabilities ``y_prob`` against the ground-truth "
"labels ``y_label`` using sklearn's ``root_mean_squared_error``:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/evaluation.md:258 e69b016e4b7c4d02ae20638ae0dfd570
msgid "``y_prob`` 通常由 ``torch.sigmoid(y_score)`` 得到，将排序分数映射到 [0,1] 区间。"
msgstr ""
